  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Chirper.jpg\" title=\"Skeer'ikt the Chirper\"><img alt=\"Skeer'ikt the Chirper\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"283\" src=\"/images/Chirper.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Chirper.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>Skeer'ikt the Chirper</b></div></div></div>\n<p>Skeer'ikt the Chirper is a Whisker who is imprisoned in a cage found in Cavernous Cavern of Caves off of level 1 of <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>. He gives the following quests:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation_Story\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation Story\">Vergrim's Vexation Story</a> (i &amp; ii)\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vacation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vacation\">Vergrim's Vacation</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim_Clan's_Bling\" title=\"Vergrim Clan's Bling\">Vergrim Clan's Bling</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
